   - Wrap makeJinaRequest with concurrency control

## Implementation
Add semaphore-based concurrency limiter:
```typescript
class ConcurrencyLimiter {
  private running = 0;
  private queue: (() => void)[] = [];
  constructor(private maxConcurrent: number = 2) {}

  async acquire(): Promise<void> {
    if (this.running < this.maxConcurrent) {
      this.running++;
      return;
    }
    return new Promise(resolve => this.queue.push(resolve));
  }

  release(): void {
    this.running--;
    if (this.queue.length > 0) {
      this.running++;
      this.queue.shift()!();
    }
  }
}
```

Apply in makeJinaRequest:
